{'symbol': 'HII', 'date': '2022-08-11 10:00:00', 'title': 'HII WAS AWARDED U.S. AIR FORCE CONTRACT TO SUPPORT\xa0MOBILITY AIR FORCE, DISTRIBUTED MISSION OPERATIONS', 'text': "MCLEAN, VA., AUG. 11, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- HII'S (NYSE: HII) MISSION TECHNOLOGIES DIVISION HAS BEEN AWARDED A MOBILITY AIR FORCE DISTRIBUTED MISSION OPERATIONS (MAF DMO) TASK ORDER UNDER THE U.S. AIR FORCE'S TRAINING SYSTEMS ACQUISITION III CONTRACT. THE $79 MILLION TASK ORDER INCLUDES A BASE PERIOD AND FIVE ONE-YEAR OPTIONS."}